# Wick's song: Lamplight, turned dark and angry. Only plays if every worker is gone.
# It opens on the Break: vibraphone, ocarina and piccolo over bass guitars, slow and sad,
# then the angry part takes over.
tempo 165
meter 4/4
grid 8
key F# minor
form Break Intro A A2

voice lead  inst=pulse duty=0.25 tone=3600 att=0.006 vol=0.36 vib=16 echo=0.2 echotime=0.75 rel=0.1 role=melody pan=-0.08 shape=0.08 human=0.002
